      "japanese": "正直者と嘘つき（３）【問題】ある島には正直者か嘘つきのどちらかしか住んでいません。",
      "english_translation": "To English: Honest People and Liars (3) [Problem]: There is an island where only either honest people or liars live."
    },
    {
