      "japanese": "正直者はつねに本当のことを言います。",
      "english_translation": "Honest people always tell the truth."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "あなたが船でその島を訪ねると、A、B、Cという３人の住民がいっしょに港で迎えてくれました。",
      "english_translation": "When you arrived at the island by boat, A, B, and C, three residents, greeted you at the harbor."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "そこで、あなたは、「あなた方の中に正直者は何人いますか」とAに尋ねました。",
      "english_translation": "Therefore, you asked A, \"How many of you are honest?\""
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "Aの答えは、まわりの人たちの声がうるさくて、よく聞こえませんでした。",
      "english_translation": "The answer to A is that I couldn't hear clearly because the voices of those around me were too loud."
    }
